From dea23558d841a72aef9b6652fe1ad920136c0aec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:48:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chore(backend): reset Qeeva-Backend to a fresh Django 5.2 LTS
 project

Remove the legacy backend (apps, migrations, db.sqlite3, committed .pyc files,
settings_fragment.py) and regenerate the folder with 'django-admin startproject core .'
using Django 5.2.19 LTS. Only Markdown files (AGENTS.md) are kept.

Nothing outside Qeeva-Backend is changed. No models, apps, or settings changes yet.
